# Scenario 'mail_addressbook': アドレスちょう (address book) incl. adding an address
# Starts from the state left by 'tutorial_profile' (adapter registered, nickname set), fake Internet on.
# Every section shows a first-use tutorial the first time it is entered; SELECT ("おわる") skips it.
# All screen names are from reading the Japanese screens (screenshots), not from the code.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title "スタート"
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # top menu: メール / ホームページ / ヘルプ (メール is preselected)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # enter メール (mail menu, first-use tutorial page)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap SELECT                   # skip tutorial
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mail_menu
tap DOWN x3
wait 30
tap A                        # enter the item
waitstable 60 max 600
shot addrbook_1
tap SELECT                   # skip its tutorial
waitstable 60 max 600
shot addrbook_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot addrbook_3
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot addrbook_4
tap DOWN
wait 40
shot addrbook_5
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot addrbook_6
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
shot addrbook_7
